OL,3,AOura pulls $15bn stock market listing
OL,4,Adays after announcement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech firm has become the latest
OL,7,Fbusiness to delay its public listing,
OL,8,Fwith experts saying the IPO market is
OL,9,Fgetting more challenging.
